@startuml
title 04  Chat · 会话、SSE 和人工审批
skinparam backgroundColor #F9FBFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #14273E
skinparam ArrowColor #446483
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBorderColor #7595B4
skinparam nodeBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam databaseBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam artifactBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FF
    ParticipantBorderColor #7595B4
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A9BF
    GroupBackgroundColor #EDF6F3
    GroupBorderColor #8EADA2
    ReferenceBackgroundColor #EDF6F3
    ReferenceBorderColor #8EADA2
}
hide footbox
actor "用户" as User
participant "DiOS Chat" as OS
database "DiOS DB" as DB
participant "TS HTTP / SSE" as Http
participant "运行模块 + SDK" as Run
participant "DSH Agent / Session" as DSH
participant "工具 / DiOS CLI" as Tool

User -> OS : 发送消息
OS -> DB : 读取展示历史，保存用户消息
OS -> Http : POST /v1/chat/completions\n现有 messages + 拟透传的 session_id
Http -> Run : 解析角色、工具选择与会话
Run -> DSH : 新建 / 恢复 Session，提交本轮输入
loop 会话执行期间
    opt 有获准工具
        DSH -> Tool : 执行 Shell / MCP / HQIT 工具
        Tool --> DSH : 结果可包含 pending_hil
    end
    DSH -->> Run : 文本或工具事件
    opt 请求 SSE
        Run -->> Http : 映射本轮事件
        Http -->> OS : 文本增量或 tool_call
        opt DiOS CLI 返回待审批
            OS -> OS : pending_hil 映射为 hil
        end
        OS -->> User : 更新回答、工具或审批提示
    end
end
DSH --> Run : 最终回答与终态
Run --> Http : 返回运行结果
alt 非流式
    Http --> OS : chat.completion JSON
    OS --> User : 最终回答
else SSE
    Http --> OS : finish chunk / [DONE]
    OS --> User : 流结束
end
OS -> DB : 保存展示用回答
note over Run, DSH
  拟由 DSH 保存模型上下文
  文本增量粒度和旧历史接续待 PoC
end note
@enduml
